{
  "__comment": "Outward-facing hull, 4 cells per face. The mirror of sky_sphere_over: every face is declared on its OUTER side, so from outside the bubble the near wall is what you see and it hides the interior, while from inside every face is backfacing and the whole shell culls away. Faces land exactly on 0/16, the same surface the inward shells use, so the two are coincident. Shares sky_sphere_over's texture signature - the shader treats them identically and only the winding differs.",
